  search_paper
  Search academic papers and extract requested information.

  Flags:
    --timeout <secs>   HTTP timeout (default: 60s)

  Arguments (--key value):
    --queries                  search terms, one per query (required)
    --information_to_extract   what information to extract from the results (optional)
    --max_results_per_query    max papers to return per query, 1-20 (optional, default: 10)

  Example:
  future tools call search_paper --queries '["CRISPR gene editing overview","CRISPR applications 2025"]' --information_to_extract "key methods and recent advances" --max_results_per_query 8
